  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline O-TORO SNAP Regular Flex is the smooth round evolution of the O-TORO platform. Using the same core performance concept as the best-selling O-TORO, SNAP changes to an ultra-slick 1.25 mm round geometry to maximize string movement and snapback while producing a lower launch angle and cleaner, purer response. Its Regular flex provides a more lively and comfortable response than O-TORO SNAP Tour Flex. It can be used as a full bed or as a low-friction cross in shaped-poly hybrid setups.",

    "zh": "Toroline O-TORO SNAP Regular Flex 是 O-TORO 平台的圆形低摩擦版本。它延续 O-TORO 的核心配方思路，但改为 1.25 毫米超光滑圆形结构，从而最大化 String Movement 与 Snapback，并带来更低的 Launch Angle 和更加纯粹、直接的击球反馈。相比 O-TORO SNAP Tour Flex，这个 Regular Flex 版本更加活跃、柔和，适用球员范围也更广。它既可以整床使用，也非常适合作为异形主线的低摩擦横线。"
  },

